<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Woolworths hopes for yr profit rise.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Woolworths hopes for yr profit rise.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grocery retailer Woolworths Ltd said on Thursday it was hoping for a slight increase in profit in the 1996/97 financial year.</p>
<p>&quot;I'm looking at certainly maintaining and I would like to think increasing slightly or marginally on last year,&quot; said Woolworths managing director Reg Clairs told reporters, when asked if profits in 1996/97 would increase.</p>
</text>
